BT /F1 10 Tf 12 TL 56 760 Td (Greenlight Commute) Tj T* () Tj T* (Greenlight Commute: Executive Summary) Tj T* () Tj T* (The Problem) Tj T* () Tj T* (Universities are under rising pressure to measure and reduce their carbon footprints, yet most) Tj T* (cannot say how much of that footprint comes from the way their own people get to campus.) Tj T* (Commuting is typically the largest single component of a campus's Scope 3 emissions; in) Tj T* (published campus inventories it commonly accounts for 20 to 40 percent of total emissions, and) Tj T* (at commuter-heavy schools more. It is also the component hardest to measure.) Tj T* () Tj T* (The standard tool is an annual travel survey. Our interviews with eleven sustainability) Tj T* (officers at institutions in our region confirmed what the literature suggests: response rates) Tj T* (average 8 to 15 percent, answers describe a single typical day rather than actual behavior, and) Tj T* (results arrive months late. One officer told us her office reports a commuting figure "we know) Tj T* (is wrong but can't improve." Meanwhile, more than 1,100 US campuses have signed public climate) Tj T* (commitments with reporting obligations, and the offices responsible are typically staffed by) Tj T* (one to three people with no data engineers.) Tj T* () Tj T* (The Solution) Tj T* () Tj T* (Greenlight Commute is a mobile app paired with an advisory service.) Tj T* () Tj T* (For commuters, the app, used with opt-in consent, logs trips to and from campus, identifies the) Tj T* (travel mode, and estimates the emissions of each trip. It then shows each user a personalized) Tj T* ("switch plan": for example, replacing three of five weekly solo drives with a bus route that) Tj T* (adds nine minutes to the trip and saves 11.4 kilograms of carbon dioxide per week. It matches) Tj T* (carpool partners among enrolled users, surfaces transit and bike-share options, and gives) Tj T* (modest rewards, such as campus-store credits funded by the university, for sustained mode) Tj T* (shifts.) Tj T* () Tj T* (For sustainability offices, we provide an anonymized, aggregated dashboard showing emissions by) Tj T* (mode, by origin zone and by population group, plus an annual advisory report formatted for) Tj T* (climate-action reporting and a set of targeted intervention recommendations, such as where a) Tj T* (new shuttle stop would remove the most solo-driving trips. Individual data is never shared with) Tj T* (the institution. Location data is aggregated before leaving our servers, and users can delete) Tj T* (their history at any time.) Tj T* () Tj T* (The distinctive element is that we deliver measurement and behavior change together. Survey) Tj T* (vendors measure but do not change behavior; consumer carbon apps change behavior but give) Tj T* (institutions no usable data. Our pilot shows the combination works.) Tj T* () Tj T* (Market) Tj T* () Tj T* (There are roughly 3,900 degree-granting institutions in the United States enrolling about 19) Tj T* (million students and employing several million faculty and staff. We focus first on the roughly) Tj T* (1,100 campuses with public climate commitments and a dedicated sustainability office. At our) Tj T* (target price of $4.50 per enrolled commuter per year, and assuming 40 percent of enrolled) Tj T* (populations commute, serving these campuses represents a serviceable market of about $38) Tj T* (million annually. Adding advisory work and extending to hospitals and large employers, which) Tj T* (face similar reporting pressure, raises the opportunity above $200 million. Our initial) Tj T* (beachhead is the 140 campuses within a day's travel of our university, where in-person advisory) Tj T* (is cost-effective.) Tj T* () Tj T* (Business Model) Tj T* () Tj T* (Revenue comes from two streams. The first is an annual software license priced per enrolled) Tj T* (commuter, ranging from $3.00 to $5.00 depending on volume, with a minimum annual fee of $6,000.) Tj T* (The second is advisory services: the annual report and intervention analysis at $9,500 for a) Tj ET
endstream
